{
  "id": "nails_and_spikes___withdrawal_force",
  "title": "Nails and Spikes - Withdrawal Force",
  "description": "Calculate the allowable withdrawal load or force for a nail or spike driven into wood using the formula F = 1380 × SG^(5/2) × D. Includes both imperial and metric calculators with reference data tables for common US and metric wire nails.",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Nails and Spikes - Withdrawal Force Calculator\n\nAllowable withdrawal load or force for a common nail or spike driven into side grain perpendicular to the fibers of seasoned wood can be estimated using:\n\n**F = 1380 × SG^(5/2) × D**\n\nWhere:\n- **F** = Allowable withdrawal load or force per inch of penetration (lb/in)\n- **SG** = Specific gravity of oven dry wood\n- **D** = Diameter of nail or spike (inches)\n\n*Note: The allowable load is 1/5 of the ultimate withdrawal resistance.*"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "content": "Imperial Units Calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "sg_imperial",
          "label": "Specific Gravity (SG) - Oven Dry Wood",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.45
        },
        {
          "id": "diameter_imperial",
          "label": "Diameter of Nail (inches)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.203,
          "unit": "in"
        },
        {
          "id": "penetration_imperial",
          "label": "Penetration Depth (inches)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "in"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "force_per_inch_imperial",
          "label": "Withdrawal Force per Inch",
          "formula": "1380 * Math.pow(inputs.sg_imperial, 2.5) * inputs.diameter_imperial",
          "unit": "lb/in",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "total_force_imperial",
          "label": "Total Withdrawal Force",
          "formula": "1380 * Math.pow(inputs.sg_imperial, 2.5) * inputs.diameter_imperial * inputs.penetration_imperial",
          "unit": "lb",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "content": "Metric Units Calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "sg_metric",
          "label": "Specific Gravity (SG) - Oven Dry Wood",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.45
        },
        {
          "id": "diameter_metric",
          "label": "Diameter of Nail (mm)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 5.15,
          "unit": "mm"
        },
        {
          "id": "penetration_metric",
          "label": "Penetration Depth (mm)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 25.4,
          "unit": "mm"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "force_per_mm_metric",
          "label": "Withdrawal Force per mm",
          "formula": "(1380 * Math.pow(inputs.sg_metric, 2.5) * inputs.diameter_metric / 25.4) / 4.448",
          "unit": "N/mm",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "total_force_metric",
          "label": "Total Withdrawal Force",
          "formula": "(1380 * Math.pow(inputs.sg_metric, 2.5) * inputs.diameter_metric / 25.4 * inputs.penetration_metric / 25.4) / 4.448",
          "unit": "N",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
